# the same dotfiles in bash on Ubuntu, in the OrbStack machine: the banner, the numbered topic
# files, then glog in the demo project. Run through record.sh, which adds the theme.
Hide
Type "clear; exec orb /tmp/demo/start"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show
Sleep 2s
Type "ls ~/dotfiles/linux/topics"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "cd demo-project"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "glog"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Screenshot "/tmp/demo/shots/linux.png"
Sleep 1s
